# FinDash Frontend Rules

## Architecture
- Standalone Angular 17 components only
- HTTP calls: `src/app/api.service.ts` (do not call HttpClient from components directly)
- Types: `src/app/models.ts`
- Routes: `src/app/app.routes.ts`
- Screens: `accounts-list/`, `account-detail/`

## Code style
- Identifiers in English; UI text in Hebrew (RTL)
- Match existing CSS patterns in component `.css` files
- No external UI/chart libraries unless approved â€” use simple CSS for visuals

## API integration
- Backend base URL: `http://localhost:3000/api` (in `api.service.ts`)
- When backend adds an endpoint, add matching method in `api.service.ts` and types in `models.ts`

## Display
- Format money with `Intl.NumberFormat('he-IL', { style: 'currency', currency })`
- Use account `currency` field (ILS, USD, etc.)
- Deposits: green badge "×”×¤×§×“×”"; withdrawals: red badge "×ž×©×™×›×”"

## After changes
1. Run `npm run build` in `frontend/` to catch compile errors
2. Verify in browser at http://localhost:4200 when possible

## Do not
- Upgrade Angular major version without approval
- Add NgModules or non-standalone patterns
